Overthrew: notice of ownership and use

Overthrew is an unofficial fork of the Dota 2 custom game Overthrow 3.0.

1. Original content. All code, maps, models, textures, sounds, text and other
   content taken from Overthrow 3.0 remain the property of their original
   authors. Dota 2 and all related names, assets and trademarks are the
   property of Valve Corporation. No rights to any of this content are claimed
   or granted by this repository.

2. Modifications. Changes made for Overthrew are shared free of charge for
   personal, non-commercial use only. They may not be sold or used in any
   monetized product or service.

3. Non-commercial. Overthrew is a friends-only passion project. It is not
   monetized, sold, sponsored or advertised, and no one earns money from it.

4. Removal requests. Rights holders who want content changed or removed can
   open an issue at https://github.com/deuscriptor/overthrew and it will be
   addressed promptly.

5. No warranty. This project is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.
   The authors of Overthrew are not liable for any damages arising from its use.
